{"id":"n28633-2-8","stage":1,"title":"힘 · 力量","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28633-2-8-1","ko":"엄마, 이제 저한테 기대세요. 제가 힘이 되어 드릴게요.","zh":"妈妈，以后您就依靠我吧，我会支持您的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기대세요.","meaning":"依靠，依，靠","explanation":"기대다：依靠，依，靠；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"기대다","audio":"/audio/94de7ced1ffbf01e16ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32494","senseId":"2","lemma":"기대다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"力量，支持，援助","explanation":"힘：力量，支持，援助；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어","meaning":"成为，是","explanation":"되다：成为，是；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"8","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"94de7ced1ffbf01e","term":"기대다","zh":"依靠，依，靠","audio":"/audio/94de7ced1ffbf01e16ac.mp3","entryId":"32494","definition":"依赖别人。","pronunciation":["기ː대다"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力量，支持，援助","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"有帮助或可以依靠的东西。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，是","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"与某人构成某种关系。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1011e295bf7540844382.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28633-2-8-2","ko":"그래, 우리 딸밖에 없구나.","zh":"嗯，还是我的女儿最靠得住。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딸밖에","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없구나.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"12","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"具有一定血缘关系的人不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccae719b517958d4faa2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.087,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28633","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.5114,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，以后您就依靠我吧，我会支持您的。","嗯，还是我的女儿最靠得住。","夏天也快要结束了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，以后您就依靠我吧，我会支持您的。","嗯，还是我的女儿最靠得住。","夏天也快要结束了。"],"answer":1}]}
